                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.48/539: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Atherton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-07-03T12:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 3,
                                1923—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 12:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>111. Your 38, June 27, 2 [<hi rendition="#italic">1</hi>] p.m. I am informed
                    Government contemplates transfer to Greece of refugees in question after signing
                    of peace.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Atherton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
